# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify), applied to every page.
# - No framing by other sites (clickjacking).
# - Browsers must not guess file types, and always use HTTPS from now on.
# - Other sites see only our domain in the Referer, not full paths.
# - Location is allowed for "Use my location" in Edit location; camera,
#   microphone and payment APIs aren't used.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()
